// Title: Activate Suppression of Windows Security Center Notifications
// Rule ID: 0c93308a-3f1b-40a9-b649-57ea1a1c1d63
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1112
// Category: registry_set
